From c487c7a00f6cb02e7df0bc4a02fc165bc02403e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:56:06 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 53/60] Muse Spark: TF_MUSE_FAST (default on; byte-identical to
 the original launches), TF_MUSE_OVERLAP (router on a side stream beside the
 latent projection and gather), TF_MUSE_EMBED_HOST (the embedding read from
 the pack's mapping: 3.3 GB a rank less)

